---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Fornax">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>Built by one person, for trades businesses that deserve better than a template</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="about-body">
    <p>
      Fornax is built and run by Tyler, working solo. The idea started from a simple observation: trades businesses —
      plumbers, HVAC techs, electricians, roofers — are often stuck choosing between a $10/month DIY builder that looks
      like every other DIY site, or a $2,000+ agency retainer they can't easily budget for. Neither gets them a site
      built specifically for their trade, checked for accessibility and speed, with leads that actually reach them.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fornax builds the site first — before a prospect ever fills out a form — so what they see in a demo is the real
      thing, not a mockup. If they say yes, it goes live in about a minute.
    </p>

    <h2>Mission</h2>
    <p>
      Give small contractors the same caliber of lead-generation website that a much bigger company would pay a full
      marketing team to build — without the retainer, the contract, or the runaround.
    </p>

    <h2>Commitments</h2>
    <ul class="commitments">
      <li><strong>No hidden fees.</strong> Pricing is published on the <a href="/pricing">Pricing page</a> and doesn't change after you sign up.</li>
      <li><strong>Cancel anytime</strong> on monthly plans, with a 30-day pro-rata refund window.</li>
      <li><strong>Real support</strong>, not a ticket queue that disappears. Published response times, a real person behind email support.</li>
      <li><strong>No fabricated results.</strong> We don't promise a specific number of leads, and we won't publish a testimonial or case study that isn't real. If you don't see proof on this site yet, it's because we don't have real customers to point to yet — not because we're hiding something.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where things stand</h2>
    <p>
      Fornax (formerly BuildFlow, rebranded 2026-09) is pre-launch. This site is a draft, not yet pointed at a live
      domain. The design and lead-generation engines are built and tested; billing, CRM sync and the customer
      dashboard are in progress. Full status lives in the internal build log, not here — nothing on this page is
      a claim about live customers or completed integrations beyond what's stated.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-footer">
    <h2>Questions about how this works?</h2>
    <p>Start with <a href="/features">Features</a> or <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>, or request a <a href="/demo">demo</a> to see it on your own business.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 20px 60px;
  }

  .about-body p {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .about-body h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 40px 0 16px;
  }

  .commitments {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .commitments li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cta-footer {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 48px 20px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
  }

  .cta-footer h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .cta-footer p {
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
